T1  - From voice to safety: Language AI powered pilot-ATC communication understanding for airport surface movement collision risk assessment
AU  - Pang, Yutian
AU  - Paul Kendall, Andrew
AU  - Porcayo, Alex
AU  - Barsotti, Mariah
AU  - Jain, Anahita
AU  - Clarke, John-Paul
JO  - Transportation Research Part C: Emerging Technologies
VL  - 184
SP  - 105540
PY  - 2026
